Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.7.4
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: sparky-stereo-mime-models
Architecture: all
Depends: shared-mime-info, ${misc:Depends}
Description: MIME types of 3D model, point cloud and splat files
 shared-mime-info has no type for PLY, Gaussian splat, SPZ, PTS, FBX, COLLADA,
 OFF and Draco files, and its release in Debian testing has none for STEP and
 BREP either. Without a type a file manager shows a PLY file as text and asks
 no thumbnailer for the others. This package adds them, with the names F3D
 uses as aliases, so that F3D's thumbnailers and desktop files match.
